---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Cookie Policy — RigGamer"
  description="RigGamer Cookie Policy. Understand what cookies we use, why, and how to manage or disable them."
>
<div class="legal-wrap">
  <div class="legal-inner">

    <div class="legal-hero">
      <div class="legal-kicker">// Legal</div>
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: <strong>September 20, 2026</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Applies to: <strong>riggamer.com</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-body">

      <h2>1. What Are Cookies</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They allow the site to remember your preferences, understand how you use the site, and serve relevant advertising.</p>

      <h2>2. Cookies We Use</h2>
      <table class="legal-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Cookie / Service</th><th>Type</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Google Analytics (_ga, _ga_*)</td><td>Analytics</td><td>Measures site traffic and user behaviour</td><td>Up to 2 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Google Ads (IDE, _gcl_au)</td><td>Advertising</td><td>Conversion tracking and remarketing</td><td>Up to 13 months</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Google Tag Manager (_gtm)</td><td>Functional</td><td>Tag management container</td><td>Session</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Meta Pixel (_fbp, _fbc)</td><td>Advertising</td><td>Audience measurement and ad targeting</td><td>Up to 3 months</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Cloudflare (__cf_bm, cf_clearance)</td><td>Security</td><td>Bot protection and security checks</td><td>Up to 1 year</td></tr>
          <tr><td>AFBOOSTER tracking</td><td>Affiliate</td><td>Affiliate click and conversion attribution</td><td>Up to 30 days</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>3. Cookie Categories</h2>
      <h3>Strictly Necessary</h3>
      <p>These cookies are required for the website to function. They include security cookies set by Cloudflare. You cannot opt out of these without disabling the site entirely.</p>
      <h3>Analytics Cookies</h3>
      <p>Google Analytics cookies help us understand how visitors interact with our content. Data is aggregated and anonymous. You can opt out via <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>
      <h3>Advertising Cookies</h3>
      <p>Google Ads and Meta Pixel use cookies to show you relevant advertisements on other sites you visit, and to track whether you completed actions after clicking our affiliate links. These are used to fund RigGamer's operations.</p>
      <h3>Affiliate Cookies</h3>
      <p>When you click a "Play Free" link on RigGamer, an affiliate tracking cookie is set by our partner network (AFBOOSTER). This cookie attributes any qualifying actions (such as launching a game) to our site so we receive a commission.</p>

      <h2>4. How to Manage Cookies</h2>
      <p>You can control or delete cookies at any time through your browser settings:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Chrome:</strong> Settings → Privacy and security → Cookies and other site data</li>
        <li><strong>Firefox:</strong> Options → Privacy & Security → Cookies and Site Data</li>
        <li><strong>Edge:</strong> Settings → Cookies and site permissions</li>
        <li><strong>Safari:</strong> Preferences → Privacy → Manage Website Data</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Note: blocking cookies may affect the functionality of some parts of this site.</p>

      <h2>5. Opt-Out of Personalised Advertising</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Google: <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">adssettings.google.com</a></li>
        <li>Meta: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/ads/preferences" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">facebook.com/ads/preferences</a></li>
        <li>All networks: <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">optout.aboutads.info</a></li>
        <li>EU users: <a href="https://www.youronlinechoices.eu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">youronlinechoices.eu</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Cookie Policy as our practices change. The "Last updated" date reflects the most recent revision.</p>

      <h2>7. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about our use of cookies: <a href="mailto:contact@riggamer.com">contact@riggamer.com</a></p>

    </div>

    <div class="legal-footer-nav">
      <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>
      <a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a>
      <a href="/disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
</Base>

<style>
.legal-wrap { background: var(--bg); padding: 48px 0 80px; }
.legal-inner { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
.legal-hero { margin-bottom: 40px; padding-bottom: 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd); }
.legal-kicker { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--volt); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.legal-hero h1 { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px); font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.legal-meta { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 13px; color: var(--t4); }
.legal-body h2 { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .03em; margin: 2em 0 .7em; padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd); }
.legal-body h3 { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--t2); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; margin: 1.4em 0 .5em; }
.legal-body p { color: var(--t2); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1em; }
.legal-body ul { color: var(--t2); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; margin: .5em 0 1em 1.4em; }
.legal-body ul li { margin-bottom: .4em; }
.legal-body a { color: var(--volt); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(198,255,51,.3); transition: border-color .15s; }
.legal-body a:hover { border-color: var(--volt); }
.legal-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 1em 0 1.5em; font-size: 14px; }
.legal-table th { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; color: var(--t4); padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--brd2); }
.legal-table td { padding: 10px 12px; color: var(--t2); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd); vertical-align: top; }
.legal-table td:first-child { color: var(--t1); font-weight: 600; }
.legal-footer-nav { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--brd); flex-wrap: wrap; }
.legal-footer-nav a { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 12px; color: var(--t3); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; transition: color .15s; }
.legal-footer-nav a:hover { color: var(--volt); }
</style>
